# Frontend pointers

Host safety only. Product and implementation truth live elsewhere.

| Need | Go to |
| --- | --- |
| Supported routes / chrome | `docs/product/supported-experience.md`, `docs/product/search-and-hud.md` |
| Exploration / camera / focus | `docs/product/galaxy-exploration.md` |
| Runtime load / idle | `docs/frontend/runtime.md` |
| Navigation | `docs/system/decision-index.md` |
| Source | `frontend/src/` (Three under `frontend/src/three/`, HUD under `frontend/src/hud/`) |
| Locale SSOT | `frontend/src/lib/locales/en.json` via `frontend/src/lib/strings.ts` |
| Tests | `frontend` Vitest / Storybook as scoped by the change |

Do not treat this rule as a second Tech Spec or Design Spec.
